#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:597
msgid ""
"The ``fir`` driver only talks to the sensor over **I²C 0** — wire the module"
" to the ``I2C_SCL`` / ``I2C_SDA`` pads (``A5`` / ``A4``)."
msgstr ""
"``fir`` ドライバは **I²C 0** 経由でのみセンサーと通信します。モジュールを ``I2C_SCL`` / ``I2C_SDA`` "
"パッド（\\ ``A5`` / ``A4``\\ ）に配線してください。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:602
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "タイミング"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:605
msgid "time"
msgstr "time"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:607
